stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PROPOSED : Brand sends proposal
    PROPOSED --> ACCEPTED : Creator accepts
    PROPOSED --> COUNTERED : Creator counter-offers
    PROPOSED --> REJECTED : Creator rejects
    COUNTERED --> ACCEPTED : Brand accepts counter
    COUNTERED --> CANCELLED : Brand cancels
    PROPOSED --> CANCELLED : Brand cancels
    ACCEPTED --> PUBLISHED : Creator submits post URL<br/>(script must be APPROVED)
    ACCEPTED --> CANCELLED : Brand cancels
    PUBLISHED --> PAID : Brand confirms payment
    PAID --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
